  body: |
    # Type A invalidity legislation in the cited EC framework

    ## Authored interpretation

    The cited framework distinguishes Type A legislation, where the invalidity-benefit rate does not depend on insurance length, from Type B legislation.

    ## Scope and boundaries

    DMG 074080–074082 cite Regulation 1408/71 and concern invalidity benefit or long-term Incapacity Benefit. This is not a classification of current ESA or New Style ESA, nor an award calculation.

    ## Inspected source passages

    - [DMG 074080, PDF page 55](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/692421b6367485ea116a55db/dmg-ch-07-part-04.pdf#page=55)
    - [DMG 074081, PDF page 55](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/692421b6367485ea116a55db/dmg-ch-07-part-04.pdf#page=55)

    ## Evidence and review status

